ion</h3>\n                <p>Repair of <strong>Water Coolers</strong> and <strong>Deep Freezers</strong> for Rajkot&#8217;s colleges, hostels, and food courts.</p>\n                <a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-rajkot\" style=\"color: var(--blue); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;\">Chilling Services</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"internal-links\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Specialized Repair Solutions</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p>Our Rajkot technicians are trained to handle a wide variety of equipment:</p>\n        <div class=\"grid-3\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/air-cooler-repair-services-rajkot\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Air Cooler Service</h4>\n                    <p>Pump replacement and pad changing for industrial coolers in Aji GIDC sheds.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-rajkot\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Industrial Chillers</h4>\n                    <p>Maintenance of process chillers used in plastic molding and forging industries.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-rajkot\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Cold Storage Repair</h4>\n                    <p>Emergency repair for food storage units in Gondal Road and marketing yard areas.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-rajkot\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Deep Freezer Repair</h4>\n                    <p>Gas charging and thermostat replacement for ice cream parlors and dairy units.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-rajkot\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>Refrigerator Repair</h4>\n                    <p>Double door and side-by-side fridge repair for apartments on Kalavad Road.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-rajkot\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:inherit;\">\n                    <h4>HVAC Projects</h4>\n                    <p>Ducting installation and repair for corporate offices and hospitals in Rajkot.</p>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"price-table\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>AC Service Price List &#8211; Rajkot (Out-of-Warranty)</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"table-container\">\n            <table>\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>Service Description</th>\n                        <th>Avg. Price (Rajkot)</th>\n                        <th>Guarantee</th>\n                        <th>Action</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Split AC Wet Service (Jet Pump)</td>\n                        <td>₹599</td>\n                        <td>30 Days</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/contact-us\">Book Now</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Split AC Gas Charging (R32/R410)</td>\n                        <td>₹2500+</td>\n                        <td>90 Days</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/shop\">Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Window AC Installation</td>\n                        <td>₹800</td>\n                        <td>6 Months</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/ac-installation-rajkot\">Book</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Panel AC Maintenance (Metoda)</td>\n                        <td>On Quote</td>\n                        <td>Service Contract</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/panel-ac-service-rajkot\">Inquire</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n        <p><em>* Prices are indicative for independent services in Rajkot. Industrial zones (Metoda/Shapar) may attract transport charges.</em></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"rajkot-areas\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Areas Served in Rajkot City</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"areas-list\">\n            Kalavad Road | University Road | 150 Ft Ring Road | Nana Mava | Amin Marg | Raiya Road | Gondal Road | Mavdi | Kotharia Road | Bhaktinagar | Atika Industrial Area | Samrat Industrial Area | Sorathiyawadi | Kotecha Chowk | Panchayat Chowk | Madhapar Chowk | Gandhigram | Sadhu Vaswani Road | Race Course | Yagnik Road | Dhebar Road | Parevadi Chowk | Morbi Road | Greenland Cross Road | Kuvadva Road | Bhagvatipara | Jungleshwar | Prahlad Plot | Junction Plot | Railnagar | Popatpara | Bajrang Wadi | Jamnagar Road | Ghanteshwer.\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"industrial-zones\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Industrial Clusters Served (GIDC)</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p>We provide priority support to these critical manufacturing zones:</p>\n        <div class=\"areas-list\">\n            Metoda GIDC (Lodhika) | Shapar-Veraval Industrial Area | Aji GIDC | Samrat Industrial Area | Atika Industrial Area | Gondal Road Industrial Zone | Kuvadva GIDC | Bamandbore GIDC | Hadamtala Industrial Area | Ribda Industrial Zone | Bhunava | Padavla.\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"faq\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Rajkot AC Service FAQs</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"faq-container\">\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">1. Are you the authorized voltas service center for Rajkot?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">No, we are a leading independent and unauthorised service provider. We specialize in out-of-warranty repairs for Rajkot&#8217;s industries and homes.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">2. Do you provide service in Metoda GIDC?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we have dedicated teams for Metoda GIDC and Lodhika Industrial Estate, serving engineering and pharmaceutical units.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">3. Can you repair Panel ACs for CNC machines?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we specialize in repairing Panel ACs used in CNC, VMC, and laser cutting machines in Shapar and Aji GIDC.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">4. How quickly can you reach Kalavad Road?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">For residential areas like Kalavad Road and University Road, we typically offer same-day service turnaround.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">5. Do you offer AMC for corporate offices?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we offer specialized AMCs for offices and showrooms on Yagnik Road and 150ft Ring Road.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">6. Is on-site gas charging available in Shapar?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, our industrial vans carry all refrigerants (R32, R410A, R22) to perform on-site charging in Shapar-Veraval factories.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">7. Can you fix water coolers in hostels?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Absolutely. We repair commercial water coolers for hostels and colleges near University Road and Kuvadva.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">8. What is the guarantee on PCB repair?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">We provide a 3-month warranty on component-level PCB repairs done at our Rajkot workshop.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">9. Do you work on Sundays in Rajkot?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we offer emergency breakdown services on Sundays, especially for industrial clients in GIDC areas.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">10. How do I book a technician?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Click the WhatsApp button or call +91 97272 57141 to schedule a visit from our Rajkot-based expert team.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"footer-links\">\n            <a href=\"/home\">Home</a> | <a href=\"/shop\">Shop</a> | <a href=\"/ac-service-center-morbi\">Morbi</a> | <a href=\"/ac-service-rajkot\">rajkot</a> | <a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Rajkot Support</a>\n        </div>\n        <p>&copy; 2026 Atlas Aircon &#8211; Independent <span class=\"focus-keyword\">voltas ac service center Rajkot</span>. The Trusted Choice for Engineering &#038; Residential Cooling.</p>\n        <p>Location: Serving Rajkot, Metoda, Shapar &#038; Kalavad Road | Phone: +91 97272 57141 | Email: atlasaircon1@gmail.com</p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // Simple FAQ toggle\n        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(item =